senses.gloss:
śīrṣaka,
(1) nt., top of a column: ˚kam Mvy 〔5576〕 = Tib. bre phul;
(2) m., helmet: ˚kaḥ (so read with Mironov for text ˚kāḥ) Mvy 〔6076〕 = Tib. rmog, helmet (alternatively, ḥtshem bu, = ? should mean something sewn, perhaps a knitted head-cover); listed among arms and armor;
(3) n. of a nāga king: Mvy 〔3283〕, but v.l. and Mironov Cicchaka.
